7633-
7634:- title: Telemetry trend memo
7635-- purpose: Provide a structure for reviewing cohort-aware telemetry, trend movement, and drift risk over time
7636-- task_family:
7637-  - `telemetry_trend`
7638-  - `evaluation_scorecard`
7639-- structure_type:
7640-  - `scorecard_style`
7641-- typical_use_shape: telemetry trend review, drift memo, cohort-aware monitoring summary
7642-- language_profile: Korean explanation + English metric labels
7643-- output_density: `standard`
7644-- context_contract:
7645-  - required:
7646-    - `trend_scope`
7647-    - `cohort_telemetry_summary`
7648-    - `drift_verdict`
7649-  - optional:
7650-    - `reviewer_burden_trend`
7651-    - `replay_coverage_trend`
7652-  - excluded:
7653-    - snapshot-only metric note presented as trend
7654-- expected_sections:
7655-  - `Acknowledgment`
7656-  - `Analysis`
7657-  - `Execution`
7658-  - `Impact & Risk`
7659-  - `Verification`
7660-- placeholder_map:
7661-  - `{trend_scope}`
7662-  - `{cohort_telemetry_summary}`
7663-  - `{drift_verdict}`
7664-- verification_pattern:
7665-  - `trend_window_check`
7666-- risk_profile:
7667-  - `medium`
7668-- cost_profile_tags:
7669-  - `monitoring_heavy`
7670-- anti_patterns:
7671-  - one data point treated as trend
7672-- generalization_boundary:
7673-  - does not replace raw monitoring data
7674-- artifact_notes:
7675-  - use when longitudinal movement, not just one score, is the real issue
7676-- example_body:
7677-~~~markdown
7678-## Acknowledgment
7679-
7680-Reviewing telemetry trends for `{trend_scope}`.
7681-
7682-## Analysis
7683-
7684-- Cohort-aware telemetry summary: `{cohort_telemetry_summary}`
7685-
7686-## Execution
7687-
7688-- Drift verdict: `{drift_verdict}`
7689-
7690-## Impact & Risk
7691-
7692-- Main risk: trend claims may overstate stability if the window is too short
7693-
7694-## Verification
